<title>UK: DSL Finance prices 1.0 billion mark 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Finance prices 1.0 billion mark 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Commerzbank, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    19.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.328   PAY DATE    19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    98.928    SPREAD	+32 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 GOV LAW    GERMAN    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  2.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR BUND</p>
